    h2 Get involved
    text W3C works at the nexus of core technology, industry needs, and societal needs. Everyone can get involved with the work we do.
    text There are many ways individuals and organizations can participate in the Web Consortium to advance web standardization.
    link "Ways to get involved" https://www.w3.org/get-involved/
